      <activity id="264b4075-e7aa-5b92-a295-49c7ce6deb47" activityNameId="b2e0d50d-80b9-5d03-9add-9ba3c7772f0b" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Office, simple sanitary installation, incl. appliances and pipes, construction</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Office, simple sanitary installation, incl. appliances and pipes, construction
Simple sanitary system for offices;
UUID: 55d366ff-2303-37bf-8807-ea5f073a1c3c
This data set includes the material use for the manufacturing of simple sanitary installations in an office building according to Klingler and Kasser, 2011 per energy reference area. The sanitary system has a life-span of 30 years. Transport is included. The average energy reference area ist 5131 m2. The building has 16 sanitary rooms and 3 installation zones.
Location: Data for Zurich, Switzerland
Technology: Average technology
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_55d366ff-2303-37bf-8807-ea5f073a1c3c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
